{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_title", "source_sha256": "fd6d10509ab4d11c4007944f725afe3e8e96872323ccbec1aa43fb6ef025abff", "ja": "震える勇気", "zh": "颤抖的勇气", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_synopsis", "source_sha256": "47ea8c06f211c1c655d02fde33241c5de6763fcc2948aca9b6eea3da1a53257c", "ja": "センター公演に向けて、特訓を始めた可憐。\n恵美達の協力もあり、特訓は順調に進んだが\n公演前日になって不安に襲われてしまう。\nプロデューサーの助言で勇気を取り戻した\n可憐は、見事にステージをやり遂げる。", "zh": "可怜为了下次的Center公演而展开特训。\n在惠美等人的协助下，特训进展得颇为顺利，\n但到了公演前夕，一股不安窜上可怜的心头。\n而听完制作人的建议后，可怜终于\n找回勇气，为表演划下漂亮的句点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d029d2fd3c4b4fbd5bd8c176d78ded9a3381c5d15ed83a77ab39345722b30abb", "ja": "（今日から、可憐センター公演のレッスンが始まる。\n恵美に、特訓を手伝って欲しいと言われたけど……）", "zh": "（从今天起，可怜担任Center的公演正式开始练习，\n而惠美请我一起帮忙特训……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "372326da9052d0ded4eae28b0bc7dd57ea0407a13c6b30b13f786d5b3c3f57b0", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nお疲れさまです。どこか行かれるんですか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n辛苦了，你要去哪里吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8bded5442dcdc80c697448c083575bebcfadff36998217972701b4ada4410497", "ja": "お疲れさま、風花。\nうん、ちょっと恵美に呼ばれてて。", "zh": "辛苦了，风花。\n嗯，惠美找我有点事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8c424e364c02c3b54aaa9a9990ffd5418298968ba31233ccdc0ef63ed7a56ce7", "ja": "もしかして、可憐ちゃんの特訓ですか？\n私もなんです。", "zh": "该不会是被找去帮可怜特训？\n我也是呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3367aad890f8842a10a367a13d0edbd6e9e60ff033a55303904cef00b9b42371", "ja": "風花も？　一体、何をする気なのかな……。\nまあとにかく、行ってみよう。", "zh": "风花你也是？她到底想做什么呀……\n算了，总之先去瞧瞧吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "0f384c27517bb6a6b06b1127dfbef663c3636bd2993c9935a5c44852b5317d5e", "ja": "み、美希ちゃん……。\nこんな感じで、ど、どうかな……？", "zh": "美、美希……\n这样子，你、你觉得如何……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "c4d61503c9147636aa3ca6d92bc2a7548f054077335cd37260297abb457977d8", "ja": "可憐、もっと思いきってやらないとダメなの！\nこんなカンジで……はいっ、ポーズ！", "zh": "可怜，这个动作要再果决一点才行！\n像这样……来，摆好姿势！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "fdc4dcae0efe5a1bda827ee8d8c6738d4a8a805dd3ad335af162e6685919fa19", "ja": "えっと……え、えいっ！　こんな感じかな……？\nうぅ、やっぱり恥ずかしい……！", "zh": "呃……嘿、嘿！这样对吗……？\n呜呜，我还是觉得很难为情……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "2511cec78db777760e35b0f5c5518e045db495a2026cef86a6ce9bd89c50c110", "ja": "篠宮さん、今の勢いはとてもよかったと思います。\nどうしても恥ずかしいなら、私も一緒に……。", "zh": "筿宫，我觉得你刚才的气势很棒。\n如果你还是觉得难为情，那我也陪你一起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1009_p", "source_sha256": "cb461d3e4901b42a86fa10baab1c6b9f70cdce39ba2650c8020248eeb808ba0a", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま。\n……何をしてるんだ？", "zh": "大家辛苦了。\n……你们在做什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "9516f5f654051cd376eecc4e7306d119bbcf473dbdd54388a34cea9be39cb10c", "ja": "ひゃあっ！？\n{$P$}さん……！", "zh": "哇啊！？\n{$P$}先生……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "e2c4dfed2f5851ed1bf15be2388c98f9b31a9888d0007ffe9850ff5195bca8c0", "ja": "ストップ、ストップ！\n可憐、そこでやめちゃったら、特訓にならないよ～？", "zh": "暂停、暂停！\n可怜，你卡在那里的话，那特训就没意义啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d1bf21a06a7c5b81f2d209e72c4ce9ee9cd3dad456d2ebca9139c00fe934fc5c", "ja": "{$P$}。\nあなたはまた、覗き見を……？", "zh": "{$P$}，\n难道你又在偷窥了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1013_p", "source_sha256": "13a1ff008d987ed4feaf901a029a493f2c2f0a194d62c65f7c9d8f93b8efe703", "ja": "いや、そうじゃなくて、恵美に呼ばれたんだけど……。\nこれが特訓なのか？　グラビアの撮影みたいだけど。", "zh": "唉唷，不是啦，我是被惠美叫来的……\n这就是特训的内容吗？怎么感觉像在拍写真照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "e21ac4153bdd467609af11910fdadfc93fdc7ba837d7efaa7c4689cbcd48922a", "ja": "にゃはは♪　{$P$}、大正解！\n人前でポーズ取るのって、けっこう勇気がいるっしょ？", "zh": "呀哈哈♪{$P$}，你答对了！\n在众目睽睽之下摆姿势，需要不小的勇气吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "7302edb5c245986484cef9671530be7d69478a9de11f0a316138285e7b7f804e", "ja": "可憐がステージで気を失わないために、特訓中なの。\nミキは、ポーズの先生ね。", "zh": "这个特训的目的，就是为了不让可怜在舞台上晕过去。\n美希是来教她怎么摆姿势的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1016_045kar", "source_sha256": "9e0caf8555d59aa5e020fba611efec1b6cd14efcb0126791b3242d5bb5558a39", "ja": "それで、あの……{$P$}さんにも、\n見てもらおうって、め、恵美ちゃんが……。", "zh": "所以，那个……惠、惠美才会要\n{$P$}也到场，在一旁看着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1017_p", "source_sha256": "b96ee808feb67ae43239b7f529f7e7dce0bfcabf920d80f3b712531d263da572", "ja": "なるほど……。確かに、集中的に見られる事を\n意識するのは、いい方法かもしれないな。", "zh": "原来如此……借此来意识到自己正被注目着，\n这方法确实不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "7413534b84ab8c8da014d66d7ff77e9199a3d771dd797b8276c0908ae0b09899", "ja": "そういうこと！　だから{$P$}も、\n可憐から目を逸らしちゃダメだよ？　わかった？", "zh": "答对了！所以{$P$}，\n你的视线也不能从可怜身上移开喔，知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1019_p", "source_sha256": "7d3392947087f4660032f7646184a911798439affb729d796ebf74cb445f02e9", "ja": "目を逸らさないか……\nわかった、努力するよ。", "zh": "不能移开视线啊……\n好，我会努力的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "aed682002d737dce6ba4fb16a7eaff9d5f76c516c54609ff5530ccb59dd8da37", "ja": "えっと、恵美ちゃん。\nそれじゃあもしかして、私が呼ばれたのって……？", "zh": "呃，惠美，\n这么说，你找我来是因为……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1021_020meg", "source_sha256": "298ace0804a7c9ecaa76bcc023023963063507a0f5442b17ed63b9d38f27db13", "ja": "もちろん、美希と一緒に先生役だよ！\nやっぱグラビアは、風花のほうが経験多いからね♪", "zh": "当然是跟美希一起当老师啰！\n毕竟写真照这方面，风花的经验比大家丰富嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1022_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4cd83fbdd2002e67351749400de56818cb5d6fe949129b7582028b4740c35977", "ja": "あ、やっぱりそうなんだ……。\nうう、想像はしてたけど……。", "zh": "啊，果然如此……\n呜呜，虽然我早就猜到了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1023_045kar", "source_sha256": "910b6aa8d61548b78c448952f24ef5971a513892f4307ccd2accda384a979266", "ja": "い、いきなり迷惑でしたよね？　風花さん……。\n私の都合ばっかり、ごめんなさい……！", "zh": "这、这么突然很让你困扰吧？风花姊……\n让你在这边指导我，对不起……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1024_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a78f8a883f9c1655d4572cfb5dc731386026021bd6dc0b9a51713103ba01d30c", "ja": "ううん！　そんなことないよ、可憐ちゃん！\n私でよかったら、なんでも聞いて？", "zh": "别这么说！我怎么会觉得困扰呢，可怜！\n你不嫌弃的话，尽管问没关系！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1025_045kar", "source_sha256": "78e7af880575dded37a3b0168f8b0700a1878d7987f836c913f12d1bf387df77", "ja": "風花さん……あ、ありがとうございます……！\nあの、質問を、みんなで考えたんです……。", "zh": "风花姊……谢、谢谢你……！\n那个，大家一起想了要请教你的问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1026_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e002f7fc48f14a37d8b437f1726155d3203d78770f64da2c694461440d816aea", "ja": "では、代表して読ませていただきます。まずは……\n『豊川さんは普段、どのような心構えで撮影を？』", "zh": "那么，就由我来代表发问。首先……\n『请问丰川平时都用什么样的心境来拍摄？』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1027_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f195558283e6cbe4b74a64dc556a398cca63e71370b013dbd54f65e22c22c5b9", "ja": "こ、心構え？　えっと、そうだなぁ……\nファンの人達に、よろこんでほしいと思ってるかな？", "zh": "心、心境？呃，这个嘛……\n应该是希望粉丝们看了会觉得开心吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1028_045kar", "source_sha256": "91b5dc5a7223067240ac3655de7f88c004551f2fead08cba96c85f1aa853a11f", "ja": "ファンの人たちに、よろこんでほしい……。", "zh": "希望粉丝们看了会觉得开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1029_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1e89046840cf448f846968d438da5d5a858ac490437b29298b33a72a09e96e1e", "ja": "うん。あとは、衣装やシチュエーションのことも\n考えて……どんなポーズがいいだろう、って。", "zh": "嗯，还有就是，把服装和场景也列入考量……\n思考该摆什么姿势。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1030_020meg", "source_sha256": "d0b807364b489a3e0f17d5d90fe66e923416ee5a34a371c7728485b8c2f26a58", "ja": "風花、ホントすごいよね～。アタシも読モだったから\n撮影は慣れてるけど、好き勝手やってたからな～。", "zh": "风花真的好厉害喔～我以前也当过读者模特儿，\n所以是挺习惯拍摄了，但都走随兴路线～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1031_003mik", "source_sha256": "045301798eec42957c0c532b77ba869a66e02d672131092e9935d927412a7342", "ja": "ミキも、恵美と一緒かな。\nミキがかわいければ、みんなよろこんでくれるの♪", "zh": "美希也跟惠美差不多。\n反正只要美希可爱，大家看了都会很开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1032_003mik", "source_sha256": "3cbeb880e5057b9da918272fecb0ae1ea70bba82e1c757ca23ce592af7d09688", "ja": "じゃあ今度は、風花がポーズ取ってみてくれる？\nやりながらのほうが、可憐もわかりやすいと思うな。", "zh": "那这次风花要不要也一起来摆姿势？\n美希觉得一边示范一边说明，可怜应该更容易理解呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1033_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e8fe45ede42e0fb864cfc62197325a3037ee2fab8d59c18dd5e2ba3731f0615e", "ja": "じゃあ、ちょっと恥ずかしいけど……\nあんまりわざとらしくなく……こ、こんな感じかな？", "zh": "好吧，虽然有点害羞……\n先摆个不要太做作的姿势……这、这样吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1034_045kar", "source_sha256": "9fd752b0d75fc9345ce05060804f55599a3a244445a1246467af4048d427e8b4", "ja": "キャッ……！\nさ、さすが風花さんです……！", "zh": "呀啊……！\n真、真不愧是风花姊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1035_p", "source_sha256": "ec86e291bb3c24a48b503391ad12f3f04e74a968c35ce1978043a30e2c586083", "ja": "うん、風花はやっぱり慣れてるな。\n経験値が違うというか……。", "zh": "嗯，风花果然很熟练呢，\n是经验的差距吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1036_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5b9e1f13d8e86a3d351196cb9bb7dfa469d45e55811c36eba69dd0b63619c30a", "ja": "も、もうっ、{$P$}さん！？\n変なこと言わないでください～っ！", "zh": "讨、讨厌！{$P$}先生！？\n你别讲这种奇怪的话啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1037_003mik", "source_sha256": "e36e37438fe82e3f94b24f37ffb25c72b735c0385825aa8be6b9e68228e050b2", "ja": "可憐も、思いきってやってみるの！\nちゃんと指先まで、セクシーを意識してね！", "zh": "可怜你也放胆试试看！\n连指尖也要做出性感的感觉喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1038_045kar", "source_sha256": "d9d594a6a5c2910d58e63707ce3430a8291044f3bbec18cc8f8b1e734cdae6fe", "ja": "わ、私も……！\nわかりました、ち、挑戦してみます……うぅっ！", "zh": "我、我也要……！\n好的，我、我挑战看看……呜呜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1039_020meg", "source_sha256": "8d7b6883f63122f9f4b8f1d39b8ca50d8adc57b26582cb2aefe39835bb8a8eb1", "ja": "{$P$}、目を逸らしちゃダメだよ！\nちゃんと可憐のコト、まっすぐ見つめて！", "zh": "{$P$}，不能移开视线！\n你要好好看着可怜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
