{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1041_045kar", "source_sha256": "380b39e23590ed3985fd7eed56341d3298d7492d06c6e29967290cf58ec76aeb", "ja": "……………………きゅ～。", "zh": "……………………呜～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1042_020meg", "source_sha256": "c3ae2d13c2ad3f34d104f5a99951ae2a25268349172fe39848a36e85f8d0b615", "ja": "わわっ、また気を失っちゃった！？\n可憐、しっかりして！　可憐～～！！", "zh": "哇哇！又晕过去了！？\n可怜，你振作一点啊！可怜～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1043_p", "source_sha256": "6250fba0a80e53c8c03e6790051cf837d799c5f32f0f519ded6c57153d5de398", "ja": "（その後、可憐は何度か気絶しながらも、\n特訓に食らい付いていった……頑張れよ、可憐！）", "zh": "（之后，可怜虽然一次又一次地昏厥，\n但她还是坚持撑完特训……加油啊，可怜！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1044_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1045_p", "source_sha256": "b3a3aa790f3b06879f9f3e2ccf9ff21a3375040a83910533f45c61fd2b15f273", "ja": "（明日はいよいよ、可憐のセンター公演だ。\n準備は整ったし、あとは本番を迎えるだけ……）", "zh": "（明天终于就是可怜的Center公演了。\n现在万事俱备，只剩下正式演出而已……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1046_045kar", "source_sha256": "307475aa1c70d0af44776c77b6a361845b1f8097195dac98a9234294f9795139", "ja": "あ、あの……。\n{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "那、那个……\n{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1047_p", "source_sha256": "a8fb5c29046c71f0c5de5e19d2c19d687d10eeda4294cf68078a0704102f8507", "ja": "可憐か、お疲れさま。\n……どうしたんだ？　暗い顔して。", "zh": "是可怜啊，辛苦了。\n……怎么啦？看起来这么没精神。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1048_045kar", "source_sha256": "69ca44e9e387919d499334fe9bf81e0285cc891e43dc046d1433aeb19fa18b31", "ja": "す、すみません、あの……\n明日の、公演のことなんですけど……。", "zh": "不、不好意思，那个……\n关于明天的公演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
