{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1050_p", "source_sha256": "c0be4568495c2d020e047ccf0974e4a62da3e4422e671256451c97bbd04a43cb", "ja": "可憐、急にどうしたんだ？　今日までレッスンも、\n特訓だって、あんなに頑張ってきたじゃないか。", "zh": "可怜，你怎么突然这样说呢？你都完成了许多\n课程跟特训，一直努力到今天了耶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1051_045kar", "source_sha256": "70e00b2c781719b28c7fd2b578c316fd4458bb0b1aa0996e08519362dfbd731b", "ja": "は、はい。けど……\nどうしても、勇気が出なくて……怖いんです……。", "zh": "是、是没错，可是……\n我实在提不起勇气……害怕得不得了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1052_045kar", "source_sha256": "977940a5ce77eace182d325f9d2bdf2a292019c5f22d62f50ea3db61ab14a97e", "ja": "せっかく、恵美ちゃんたちが力になってくれたのに……\nこんなにも、応援してくれてるのに……。", "zh": "难得惠美她们帮了我这么多……\n还一直为我加油……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1053_045kar", "source_sha256": "929f44763dfb96d141460d2250ce343bb761d2c27f2428f6b8dd42ac620a42a0", "ja": "わ、私が失敗してしまって……みんなの\n期待を裏切ってしまうことが、こ、怖いんです……！", "zh": "但、但我真的好担心会搞砸……\n好怕自己会辜、辜负大家的期待……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1054_p", "source_sha256": "ab758361f7a4938bf2fbe71f95a6b34d254d54a918d232134c3bb0654e59ab57", "ja": "可憐……。", "zh": "可怜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_1055", "source_sha256": "a65cf9b07f1a3ff7dc5337c67c49ff4d2022f6252badd29b85fddf4a942c0bfc", "ja": "思い出そう！", "zh": "回想一下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_2000_p", "source_sha256": "e9e9bceb0ef027ad12d2503be5801c20fc56d049cefa8c88108e272da8b817a8", "ja": "思い出してくれ、可憐。可憐はスカウトされた後、\n街中で俺の事を待っていてくれたじゃないか。", "zh": "可怜，你回想一下，你当时被我发掘后，\n不是一直在街上等我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_2001_p", "source_sha256": "7d59d4340b442dab366f95c77b0bdb38298aaba480a8f4fcbd285eca22d02aee", "ja": "自分では気付いてないかもしれないけど、\n可憐は人一倍、勇気を持っているんだ。", "zh": "或许你自己没有发现，\n但你其实比别人更有勇气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_2002_045kar", "source_sha256": "ab9074ffe3339caf0bb34cdb74f30240cad84d9c54547b57771da1e04335b3c1", "ja": "そ、そんなことありません……！\n私なんて、こんなにも臆病なのに……。", "zh": "才、才没那回事……！\n我个性这么懦弱胆小……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_2003_p", "source_sha256": "2a4411b4c3e6b75693d8eb9de0364de28fc6627f6f6e5aba3d5f950a3650d207", "ja": "いいや。スカウトに答えるために、いつ来るかも\nわからないプロデューサーを、雑踏で待ち続けたんだ。", "zh": "你错了，你当时为了给我答复，一直在\n茫茫人海中等我这个不知何时会出现的制作人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_2004_p", "source_sha256": "312723392ef4c934716c6e3e6b6393e62ca77d5f9f6af482eea3bb3d57734067", "ja": "それは、凄い勇気だよ。", "zh": "这个行为本身就非常需要勇气了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_2005_045kar", "source_sha256": "18664c4ce7f9174b6e91374f24fc9566e58535bf57e9fc0ddb699a94f472b14d", "ja": "あ、あのときは……その、\nただ、必死だっただけで……。", "zh": "那、那个时候……我只是，\n拚了命不顾一切罢了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_2006_p", "source_sha256": "04ff2d8360fe607a228140b193ec83e27e0a2b94614ea9a2f45992ace8eef598", "ja": "そうだな。今だって可憐は、必死に戦ってる。\nそんな可憐だから、みんな応援したくなるんだよ。", "zh": "是啊，但可怜你现在也很拚命奋斗。\n正因为你这么努力，大家才想为你加油啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_2007_045kar", "source_sha256": "688e55d8843b5d65aa54925e71e2c140ad3335a752a78282e56757952ea7cb59", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nうぅ……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_2008_p", "source_sha256": "97a6c88879a8af9ce916ecc168eaf1b7e4bbcc7a7df04ab625fe46dcd209ce58", "ja": "それに、もし可憐がみんなの力になってあげたとして。\n失敗しちゃった相手を、嫌いになるか？", "zh": "而且可怜，你换个角度想，今天你去帮了其他伙伴，\n会因为对方最后失败就心生厌恶吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_039_2009_045kar", "source_sha256": "df619873ef7f830d944904311125c7766a1e547f3ff556340ae7dff3dc14a629", "ja": "そ、そんな！\nみんなを嫌いになんて、絶対、なりません……！", "zh": "怎、怎么会呢！\n我是绝对不可能、讨厌大家的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
